    "updated_at": "2016-10-17T17:35:23Z",
    "body": "Why are structs and small arrays treated differently? Is blasting apart small arrays (the same way small structs are blasted apart) an easy optimization to add? I believe the old back ends did this for arrays of size <= 4 or something like that.\n\n/cc @dr2chase @randall77 @cherrymui \n",
