    "created_at": "2016-10-21T16:42:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-21T16:42:10Z",
    "body": "Yes, if we knew that all accesses were constant indexes we could registerize it.\nOr if it is [1] we can registerize it, because the only index that can get past the bounds check is 0.\n",
